;; Handwritten WebAssembly SIMD128 SSIMULACRA 2 kernel (meter, libjxl binary32 reading, streaming bands, and integer cell sums).
;; The libjxl blurs may hand off to the relaxed-SIMD fused leaf (ssimulacra2-fused.wat) through one funcref table; the binary64 meter has no relaxed SIMD and no hash table.
;;
