  (func $s2_horiz_libjxl (param $w i32) (param $mask i32) (param $held_p1_mask i32) (param $outputs i32) (param $made i32) (param $rows i32) (param $g i32)
    (local $wb i32) (local $c i32) (local $o i32) (local $held i32) (local $cc i32) (local $r i32) (local $atb i32) (local $k i32) (local $ac i32)
